  "title": "Honey-Brined Fried Chicken Breasts",
  "description": "Give Chef John&#39;s recipe for honey-brined fried chicken a try for chicken that&#39;s crispy on the inside and surprisingly juicy on the outside.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2012-04-16T20:33:58-04:00",
